## Figma Integration (API Mode & Tool Mode)

### When to use
- User wants to link a translation key to its Figma design frame
- User provides a label that should match a Figma frame name
- User wants visual confirmation of the Figma frame before linking

### Figma Sync Workflow

Step-by-step orchestration flow when user triggers Figma sync (also used inline during Figma node selection steps in translation flows).

```
1. get_figma_screen_config(screen_id)
   → get file_key + page_name + node_ids

2. Build a Figma URL for EACH configured node:
   https://www.figma.com/file/{file_key}?node-id={node_id}

3. Show the list to the user:
   "Here are the Figma sections for screen `{screen_id}`.
    Open each link and pick the one that contains your text:

    1. https://www.figma.com/file/{file_key}?node-id=35773:267354
    2. https://www.figma.com/file/{file_key}?node-id=35773:267356
    3. https://www.figma.com/file/{file_key}?node-id=35505:113695
    4. None of these (paste a different node link)
    5. Skip"

